        },
        {
          "index": 1,
          "type": "input",
          "title": "You'll want to know: ஊசி",
          "segments": [
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "ஊசி (ūsi) — \"a needle\"."
            },
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "The sewing needle, and whatever else is that shape. It is the tool துணி is repaired with, which is most of what துணி asks for."
            },
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "Kannada ಸೂಜಿ (sūji) and Telugu సూది (sūdi) hold on to a sound at the front that Tamil let go of, so Tamil's is the shortest of the three. Open it on a long ஊ."
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "index": 2,
          "type": "notice",
          "title": "What you've built",
          "segments": [
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "The first of five made things."
            }
          ]
        },
        {
