              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "குடை (kuṭai) — \"an umbrella\"."
            },
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "Against மழை and against the சூரியன் equally, and in Tamil country the second job is the larger one. It is carried in a month with no rain in it without anybody thinking that odd."
            },
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "Kannada ಕೊಡೆ (koḍe) is the same word. It ends on the ை you already put on கூடை and on விதை."
            }
          ]
        },
